    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gary O'Driscoll & Co. Ltd are delighted to bring to the market No. 80 Knockmoyle, a well-located four-bedroom semi-detached property situated within easy walking distance of Tralee Town Centre.\n\nThe property extends to a spacious two-storey residence and offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, making it an ideal family home or investment opportunity. The ground floor briefly comprises an entrance porch, entrance hallway, kitchen, dining room, sitting room, utility room, office and guest WC. Upstairs, there are four bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom, together with the main family bathroom.\n\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating, all mains services and a private rear garden. Its central location is a particular feature, with Tralee Town Centre and its extensive range of shops, restaurants, schools, public transport links and recreational amenities all within comfortable walking distance.\n\nNo. 80 Knockmoyle offers excellent potential for those seeking a spacious four-bedroom home in a convenient and established residential location close to all that Tralee has to offer.\n\nEntrance porch 0.72 x 2.14\n\n Entrance hallway 2.10 x 3.65\n\n Kitchen 3.51 x 4.46\n\n Dining room 3.24 x 3.54\n\n Sitting room 3.52 x 3.79\n\n Utility room 2.50 x 2.95\n\n Office 2.52 x 1.98\n\n Guest toilet 0.80 x 1.45\n\n Landing 2.72 x 1.95\n\n Main bathroom 1.66 x 2.23\n\n Bedroom 4.21 x 2.40\n\n Bedroom 2.87 x 3.72\n\n Master bedroom 3.56 x 3.07\n\n Bedroom 4 2.87 x 2.57 "
